727 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 312 0 R
/E (Influencer marketing can be one of the most explosive growth channels for your brand, but managing it internally is often a logistical nightmare. Sifting through fake followers, negotiating rates, and chasing down late deliverables can drain your team's time. At Walktopus, our Influencer Coordination service provides complete, end-to-end management of your influencer campaigns. We act as the dedicated liaison between your brand and the creators, handling everything from initial discovery and outreach to rigorous deliverable tracking, ensuring you get authentic content and a measurable return on your investment.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
